l},{"mode":"bus","line":"59","minutes":20,"summary":"59","from":"Brixton Station","to":"Baylis Road / Lower Marsh","towards":"Smithfield, St Bartholomew's Hospital"},{"mode":"walking","line":null,"minutes":6,"summary":"Walk","from":"Baylis Road / Lower Marsh","to":"12A MEPHAM STREET, LONDON","towards":null}],"reason":null,"name":"London Waterloo"}],"bestHub":{"name":"Oxford Circus","minutes":27},"missing":[]},"summary":"**NO DEPOSIT OPTION AVAILABLE FOR TENANTS** (please call for more information)<br /><br />Funky, fabulous and fun is how I would describe this rather special apartment. You have two double bedrooms, a modern open plan living space, modern bathroom and access to the most epic roof terrace. The location is on point too!<br /><br />Off the high street behind an unassuming façade enter into this rather impressive mansion apartment block. Bring the bike in and secure it in the cycle store. Then ascend the stairs to the second floor. Step inside to a welcome lobby area (the video entry phone is here - so you can buzz your friends in) there is also a handy cubby here too. Through door find the open plan living room, light and bright in white, with carpet underfoot, cosies up the space. The kitchen is divided by the breakfast bar area, and included appliances are dishwasher, fridge, freezer, washing machine, oven and hob. <br /><br />The bedrooms are both comfy doubles, with white painted floors and walls for a modern and bright vibe. Finally the bathroom is well fitted with a white suite and shower over the tub, fully tiled with brick laid tiles.<br />The entire mansion block has the most fantastic roof garden that spans the entire space like a scene from Mary Poppins! You have your own little corner allocated as your own, here you can have a bbq with friends or chill out with a glass of vino.<br /><br />If you can ever tear yourself away from home, you can make the most this buzzy location has to offer. Brixton Market is a hive of activity and choc full of treats to explore and buy, only a two minute walk away. Those on the commute can be on the train from Loughborough Junction to Blackfriars or hop on the train or tube at Brixton with connections to Victoria.<br /><br />Rent: £2000 pcm excludes the tenancy deposit and any other permitted payments.<br /><br />Holding Deposit: One week's rent £461.54, based on the advertised rent, to secure the property whilst referencing is conducted. This will be offset against the full security deposit.<br /><br />Security Deposit: Five weeks' rent in total, including the Holding Deposit, £2,307.69, is collected along with your first month's rent. On qualifying properties, you may consider our Leaders Residency (No Deposit Option) Service where you do not need to pay a security deposit. Please enquire for more information.<br /><br />Tenancy Term : Assured Periodic Tenancy (APT)<br /><br />EPC: C<br /><br />Council Tax: D<br /><br />Parking: No allocated parking. You may wish to investigate on-street parking options and check whether any permits are available.<br /><br />Utilities: Metered gas, electricity and mains water & sewerage. Please contact us for further information.<br /><br />Broadband and Phone: We understand that most broadband providers service the area. The onus is on you, the consumer, to ascertain the viability and availability of services to the property. Broadband options and mobile phone coverage can be checked via the Ofcom broadband and mobile coverage checker.<br /><br />Room Sizes/Floor Plan: Whilst every care is taken to provide as accurate a floor plan and room measurements as possible, these are provided as a guide only and cannot be relied upon. You should therefore make your own investigations and measurements to satisfy any specific requirements.<br /><br />Tenants' Insurance: As part of the Government's How to Rent Guide, it is highly recommended that tenants take out appropriate contents insurance to protect their belongings, as these will not be covered by any landlord policy.<br /><br />Flood Risk: Should you have any concerns regarding flood risk, please check the property's postcode using the relevant Government flood risk information service.<br /><br />Construction: Standard construction, brick built.<br /><br />More Information: Please refer to our website or contact your local branch for further information or clarification.","keyFeatures":["**No Deposit Option","Communal Roof Terrace","Two double bedrooms","Great Location!","On Street Parking"],"outcode":"SW9","images":[{"url":"https://media.rightmove.co.uk/property-photo/779b411b0/94532457/779b411b05d2b5624ce3482a3af0916b.jpeg","kind":"photo","caption":"1Front"},{"url":"https://media.rightmove.co.uk/property-photo/212e574d1/94532457/212e574d12af46aaffc3932f1a8aa102.jpeg","kind":"photo","caption":"Living to kitchen"},{"url":"https://media.rightmove.co.uk/property-photo/5643f2875/94532457/5643f2875867a59dfc1659139d750968.jpeg","kind":"photo","caption":"Picture No. 36"},{"url":"https://media.rightmove.co.uk/property-photo/e0757c2ce/94532457/e0757c2ce4a5b86cc799a7951b544dc3.jpeg","kind":"photo","caption":"Living to kitchen"},{"url":"https://media.rightmove.co.uk/property-photo/018a4cef9/94532457/018a4cef9d49b71d6db87d53a92d43fd.jpeg","kind":"photo","caption":"pbox-IMG.jpg"},{"url":"https://media.rightmove.co.uk/property-photo/6071fa9a5/94532457/6071fa9a507ffd5e301d6fc8bbc096ee.jpeg","kind":"photo","caption":"Kitchen"},{"url":"https://media.rightmove.co.uk/property-photo/823e6c7d2/94532457/823e6c7d20c367fd77561c27bb12bf83.jpeg","kind":"photo","caption":"pbox-IMG.jpg"},{"url":"https://media.rightmove.co.uk/property-photo/b128ae1ab/94532457/b128ae1abfc319ea4249f2ffbda5557c.jpeg","kind":"photo","caption":"pbox-IMG.jpg"},{"url":"https://media.rightmove.co.uk/property-photo/5f5772657/94532457/5f5772657103f9fef1c46a5a87695766.jpeg","kind":"photo","caption":"pbox-IMG.jpg"},{"url":"https://media.rightmove.co.uk/property-photo/2e8260449/94532457/2e826044958f50c068b